# Original Unity DCGO project — large, local-only reference for AS-IS parity (not committed).
/DCGO/

# Locally pinned .NET SDK (~700MB) — provided by setup-dotnet on CI, present locally otherwise.
/.dotnet/

# Build output.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

# Scratch / temporary working files.
/.tmp/

# Large archives / snapshots — never commit (GitHub 100MB limit; use out-of-band transfer).
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# IDE / editor.
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.swp

# Test results.
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/

# RL 학습환경 (rl/ — dev design §0.1): 실험 산출물·Python 로컬 환경은 추적하지 않는다.
/runs/
rl/.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/

# 카드 포팅 IR 산출물 (tools/CardIrExtractor + build_card_db.py로 재생성 — DCGO/ 로컬 원본 의존)
/docs/porting/card_ir.jsonl
/docs/porting/card_ir.sqlite
.claude/worktrees/
rl/opsd/arena.db*
rl/opsd/model-aliases.json
rl/opsd/model-hidden.json
